Footbag Network
===============

Footbag Network is a fork of FluffyChat.

Upstream project:  FluffyChat — https://github.com/krille-chan/fluffychat
Upstream authors:  Christian Kußowski and Contributors to FluffyChat
Upstream license:  GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 or later
