Fork date:         October 2026

Footbag Network is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License
v3.0 or later, the same license as the upstream project. See LICENSE.

This is a modified version of FluffyChat. Modifications include, but are
not limited to: rebranding (application name, identifiers, icons, theme),
removal of the voice/video calling subsystem, and configuration changes
binding the application to a specific Matrix homeserver. The complete
history of modifications is available in this repository's git history.

